url: https://github.com/gufranco/ti-tms9918-python
abstract: >-
  A model of the Texas Instruments TMS9918A, TMS9928A and TMS9929A video display processors, advanced one master clock tick at a time: the port protocol, the four display modes, the sprite rules and the status flags, the line and frame timing of all three parts, and when the processor's video memory accesses land. Every fact names the page of the 1982 TI data manual it was read from, and every fact the manual does not print names the implementation it came from and the measurement that would settle it.
